1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:05,135
Under the Sea! Ocean Animals with Mimo!

2
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:12,071
Mimo: Hi friends! We're at the beach! Let's learn about the animals that live in the big blue ocean!

3
00:00:12,371 --> 00:00:15,787
Pip: Splish, splash! Who lives under the sea?

4
00:00:17,487 --> 00:00:23,677
Mimo: First, a fish! Fish swim with their fins and their tail. Swish, swish!

5
00:00:23,977 --> 00:00:25,536
Mimo: Can you say fish?

6
00:00:27,436 --> 00:00:30,619
Pip: Let's swim like a fish! Swish, swish!

7
00:00:34,319 --> 00:00:39,005
Mimo: This is a whale! A whale is the biggest animal in the whole ocean!

8
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:44,600
Mimo: Whales breathe through a hole on top of their head. Pfffft!

9
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,342
Mimo: Can you say whale?

10
00:00:48,867 --> 00:00:50,518
Bruno: The biggest? Bigger than me?

11
00:00:50,818 --> 00:00:53,815
Mimo: Much, much bigger than you, Bruno!

12
00:00:55,515 --> 00:01:05,850
Mimo: This is an octopus! An octopus has eight arms! Let's count them. One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight!

13
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,939
Mimo: Can you say octopus?

14
00:01:09,839 --> 00:01:12,755
Bruno: Eight arms? I could hold eight cookies at once!

15
00:01:16,455 --> 00:01:21,138
Mimo: Here's a crab! Crabs walk sideways. Pinch, pinch!

16
00:01:21,438 --> 00:01:22,887
Mimo: Can you say crab?

17
00:01:24,787 --> 00:01:27,186
Bruno: Let's walk like a crab! Sideways!

18
00:01:31,929 --> 00:01:38,882
Mimo: This is a sea turtle! Turtles carry their house on their back. They swim slowly through the water.

19
00:01:39,182 --> 00:01:40,549
Mimo: Can you say turtle?

20
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:44,639
Bruno: Slow... like... a... turtle.

21
00:01:46,339 --> 00:01:50,447
Mimo: Look! It's a starfish! It's shaped like a star!

22
00:01:50,747 --> 00:01:52,489
Mimo: Can you say starfish?

23
00:01:54,389 --> 00:01:56,696
Pip: Twinkle, twinkle, little starfish!

24
00:01:58,396 --> 00:02:03,007
Mimo: And this is a jellyfish! It's wiggly and jiggly, like jelly!

25
00:02:03,307 --> 00:02:05,021
Mimo: Can you say jellyfish?

26
00:02:06,921 --> 00:02:08,248
Bruno: Jelly? Can I eat it?

27
00:02:08,548 --> 00:02:13,694
Mimo: No, Bruno! Jellyfish can sting. We just look at them!

28
00:02:13,994 --> 00:02:15,343
Bruno: Okay. Just looking.

29
00:02:15,643 --> 00:02:19,477
Mimo: Let's say all the ocean animals together! Ready?

30
00:02:19,777 --> 00:02:20,476
Pip: Fish!

31
00:02:21,276 --> 00:02:21,770
Bruno: Whale!

32
00:02:22,570 --> 00:02:23,671
Mimo: Octopus!

33
00:02:24,471 --> 00:02:25,008
Bruno: Crab!

34
00:02:25,808 --> 00:02:26,588
Pip: Turtle!

35
00:02:27,388 --> 00:02:28,546
Mimo: Starfish!

36
00:02:29,346 --> 00:02:31,148
Bruno: Jellyfish! Wiggle, wiggle!

37
00:02:32,748 --> 00:02:37,147
Mimo: Great job, ocean explorers! Bye bye, friends!
